WEBVTT

00:00:00.540 --> 00:00:00.990
Hello!

00:00:01.098 --> 00:00:04.443
Want to ask whether the salon has a free slot, what something costs,

00:00:04.393 --> 00:00:06.430
or tell them something before your visit?

00:00:06.777 --> 00:00:10.510
Message the salon right on VaraaAi, no phone call needed.

00:00:11.100 --> 00:00:16.191
Open the salon's page, and tap the button Chat with salon, right next to Book now.

00:00:16.817 --> 00:00:18.290
The chat window opens.

00:00:18.382 --> 00:00:22.050
Type your question in the box, Type a message, and tap send.

00:00:22.461 --> 00:00:25.970
You can also attach a photo, for example a nail design you like.

00:00:26.613 --> 00:00:30.226
When the salon replies, the message appears straight away in the chat.

00:00:30.494 --> 00:00:34.146
To find it again later, tap your name at the top, and choose Inbox.

00:00:34.542 --> 00:00:36.546
All your conversations with salons are there.

00:00:36.733 --> 00:00:38.066
Now take the quiz below!
